    {
      "text": "Light-blue tile labelled “OE4” with a white icon of three stacked bowl shapes. Its text reads “Propugnar sistemas de salud centrados en las personas facilitados por medio de la salud digital” (advocate people-centred health systems that are enabled by digital health).",
